  <!-- ── Package-specific questions ─────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW MUCH FOR A SINGLE SONG</pattern>
    <template>A single commissioned track is $199 for individuals and creators, or $299 for organizations. Includes 3 revision rounds, broadcast-ready WAV + MP3, and full commercial rights. Which commission type applies to you?
      <quick-replies><reply>Individual</reply><reply>Organization</reply><reply>Content Creator</reply></quick-replies>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW MUCH FOR ONE SONG</pattern>
    <template>A single track is $199 for individuals and creators, or $299 for organizations. Which applies to you?
      <quick-replies><reply>Individual</reply><reply>Organization</reply><reply>Content Creator</reply></quick-replies>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW MUCH IS A SINGLE</pattern>
    <template>A single song commission is $199 for individuals and creators, or $299 for organizations — 3 revisions and full commercial rights included. Which type are you?
      <quick-replies><reply>Individual</reply><reply>Organization</reply><reply>Content Creator</reply></quick-replies>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW MUCH IS AN EP</pattern>
    <template>An EP (3–4 songs) is $349 for individuals and creators, or $449 for organizations. Includes 3 revision rounds per song and full commercial rights on all tracks. Which type are you?
      <quick-replies><reply>Individual</reply><reply>Organization</reply><reply>Content Creator</reply></quick-replies>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW MUCH IS AN LP</pattern>
    <template>An LP (5–7 songs) is $549 for individuals and creators, or $649 for organizations. Includes 3 revision rounds per song and full commercial rights. Which type are you?
      <quick-replies><reply>Individual</reply><reply>Organization</reply><reply>Content Creator</reply></quick-replies>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW MUCH IS A FULL ALBUM</pattern>
    <template>A Full Album (8+ songs) is $849 for individuals and creators, or $899 for organizations — plus $99 for each song beyond 8. Which type are you?
      <quick-replies><reply>Individual</reply><reply>Organization</reply><reply>Content Creator</reply></quick-replies>
    </template>
  </category>

  <!-- ── Add-ons ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>ADD ONS</pattern>
    <template>Our optional add-ons:

Extra revision round   $25/round per song
Stems (separated tracks) $49
Expedited Delivery — Single  $75 (5–7 days)
Expedited Delivery — EP      $150 (7–10 days)
Expedited Delivery — LP      $250 (2–3 weeks)
Expedited Delivery — Album   $400 (~6 weeks)
Lyric video                  Coming soon

All add-ons are available at checkout or on request.
      <nav-card label="View Add-Ons" href="/services#addons" description="Full add-on details on the pricing page"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT ARE THE ADD ONS</pattern>
    <template>Our optional add-ons:

Extra revision round   $25/round per song
Stems (separated tracks) $49
Expedited Delivery — Single  $75 (5–7 days)
Expedited Delivery — EP      $150 (7–10 days)
Expedited Delivery — LP      $250 (2–3 weeks)
Expedited Delivery — Album   $400 (~6 weeks)
Lyric video                  Coming soon
      <nav-card label="View All Add-Ons" href="/services#addons" description="Full details on the pricing page"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT EXTRAS DO YOU OFFER</pattern>
    <template>We offer several optional add-ons: extra revision rounds ($25/round per song), separated track stems ($49), expedited delivery (from $75 depending on package), and a lyric video service coming soon. Want the full breakdown?
      <nav-card label="View Add-Ons" href="/services#addons"/>
      <quick-replies><reply>Tell me about stems</reply><reply>Tell me about expedited delivery</reply></quick-replies>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>DO YOU OFFER EXPEDITED DELIVERY</pattern>
    <template>Yes — expedited delivery is available for every package size:

Single  $75  (cuts to 5–7 days)
EP      $150 (cuts to 7–10 days)
LP      $250 (cuts to 2–3 weeks)
Album   $400 (cuts to ~6 weeks)

Expedited delivery is subject to studio availability — mention your deadline in your commission form and we'll confirm.
      <nav-card label="View Add-Ons" href="/services#addons"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT ARE STEMS</pattern>
    <template>Stems are the separated individual tracks from your song's production — for example, the vocal track, the instrumental track, and any individual instrument layers. They're useful if you plan to remix, license, or do further production work. Stems are available as an add-on for $49.</template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>TELL ME ABOUT STEMS</pattern>
    <template>Stems are the individual separated audio layers from your production — vocal, instrumental, drums, bass, etc. They're useful for remixing, licensing, or future production work. Available as an add-on for $49 per commission.</template>
  </category>

  <!-- ── What's included ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IS INCLUDED IN THE PRICE</pattern>
    <template>Every commission includes: original lyrics and full production, 3 rounds of revisions, broadcast-ready WAV + MP3 masters, full commercial rights, and PRO registration. Optional add-ons (stems, expedited delivery, extra revisions) are available separately.</template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IS INCLUDED</pattern>
    <template>Every commission includes original lyrics and production, 3 revision rounds, broadcast-ready audio (WAV + MP3), full commercial rights, and PRO registration. Anything specific you'd like to know more about?
      <quick-replies><reply>What about revisions?</reply><reply>What about royalties?</reply><reply>What are the add-ons?</reply></quick-replies>
    </template>
  </category>

  <!-- ── Misc ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>* DISCOUNT *</pattern>
    <template>We don't currently offer standard discounts, but our pricing is designed to be accessible for the quality delivered. If you have a specific budget or a large multi-song project, feel free to reach out and we can discuss options.
      <nav-card label="Contact Us" href="/contact"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>DO YOU OFFER PAYMENT PLANS</pattern>
    <template>Payment plan options can be discussed during your commission inquiry. Reach out via our contact form and we'll be happy to work something out.
      <nav-card label="Start Your Inquiry" href="/contact"/>
    </template>
  </category>

