  <!-- ── Payment methods and timing ────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW DO I PAY</pattern>
    <template>We accept all major credit and debit cards, processed securely through SamCart at checkout. Payment is completed before production begins — standard practice for custom creative work — so the process is secure and completely straightforward.
      <nav-card label="View Services &amp; Pricing" href="/services" description="Browse packages and proceed to checkout"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT PAYMENT METHODS DO YOU ACCEPT</pattern>
    <template><srai>HOW DO I PAY</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>DO YOU TAKE CREDIT CARDS</pattern>
    <template><srai>HOW DO I PAY</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>DO YOU ACCEPT PAYPAL</pattern>
    <template><srai>HOW DO I PAY</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHEN DO I PAY</pattern>
    <template>Payment is made at checkout before production begins. This is standard for bespoke creative work — it allows us to dedicate full attention to your commission from the moment your order is placed.
      <nav-card label="View Services &amp; Pricing" href="/services"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>DO I PAY UPFRONT</pattern>
    <template><srai>WHEN DO I PAY</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>DO I PAY BEFORE OR AFTER</pattern>
    <template><srai>WHEN DO I PAY</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>IS THERE A DEPOSIT</pattern>
    <template>For single-song commissions, payment is made in full at checkout — there's no separate deposit step. For larger packages like an EP, LP, or full album, reach out via our inquiry form and we can discuss payment options that fit the scope of the project.
      <nav-card label="Contact Us" href="/contact" description="Inquire about larger projects"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <!-- ── SamCart / checkout ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IS SAMCART</pattern>
    <template>SamCart is the secure payment platform we use for all commissions. It's a standard credit card checkout — no account required, just your card details and a few clicks. Your payment information is handled entirely by SamCart's secure infrastructure.</template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IS THE CHECKOUT</pattern>
    <template><srai>WHAT IS SAMCART</srai></template>
  </category>

  <!-- ── EP and LP definitions ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IS AN EP</pattern>
    <template>EP stands for Extended Play — a short-form collection of original songs. Our EP packages include 3–4 original commissioned songs, perfect for a small themed collection, a milestone gift set, or an introductory body of work for a brand or organization.
      <nav-card label="View Pricing" href="/services" description="See all package options"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT DOES EP MEAN</pattern>
    <template><srai>WHAT IS AN EP</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW MANY SONGS IN AN EP</pattern>
    <template><srai>WHAT IS AN EP</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IS AN LP</pattern>
    <template>LP stands for Long Play — a fuller body of original commissioned work. Our LP packages include 5–7 original songs, suited for organizations building a musical identity, individuals marking a significant chapter, or creators developing a themed release.
      <nav-card label="View Pricing" href="/services" description="See all package options"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT DOES LP MEAN</pattern>
    <template><srai>WHAT IS AN LP</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>HOW MANY SONGS IN AN LP</pattern>
    <template><srai>WHAT IS AN LP</srai></template>
  </category>

  <!-- ── Minimum order / entry price ───────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IS THE CHEAPEST OPTION</pattern>
    <template>Our starting price is $199 for a single-song commission for individuals or content creators, and $299 for organizations. There's no minimum quantity beyond one song — so you can start with exactly what you need and build from there.
      <nav-card label="View Services" href="/services" description="Browse all packages"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IS THE MINIMUM ORDER</pattern>
    <template><srai>WHAT IS THE CHEAPEST OPTION</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>IS THERE A MINIMUM</pattern>
    <template><srai>WHAT IS THE CHEAPEST OPTION</srai></template>
  </category>

  <!-- ── Adding more songs later ────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>CAN I ORDER MORE SONGS LATER</pattern>
    <template>You can commission additional songs at any time — each new order is treated as a fresh commission and priced accordingly. There's no requirement to buy a package upfront if you'd rather start with one song and return when you're ready for more.
      <nav-card label="View Services" href="/services" description="Browse all packages"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>CAN I ADD SONGS AFTER</pattern>
    <template><srai>CAN I ORDER MORE SONGS LATER</srai></template>
  </category>

  <!-- ── Subscription ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>IS THERE A SUBSCRIPTION</pattern>
    <template>Subscription plans are something we're actively developing, but they aren't available just yet. For now, all commissions are priced per project — so you only pay for what you order. Stay close to the site; we'll be announcing subscription options when they go live.
      <nav-card label="View Current Pricing" href="/services"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>DO YOU OFFER SUBSCRIPTION PLANS</pattern>
    <template><srai>IS THERE A SUBSCRIPTION</srai></template>
  </category>

  <!-- ── Price negotiation ──────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>CAN I NEGOTIATE THE PRICE</pattern>
    <template>Our pricing reflects the quality, craft, and time invested in each commission — it isn't structured for traditional negotiation. That said, if you have a specific budget or a multi-song project in mind, reach out and we'll talk through what's possible. We'd rather find a way to work together than lose a commission to a number.
      <nav-card label="Get in Touch" href="/contact"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>IS THE PRICE NEGOTIABLE</pattern>
    <template><srai>CAN I NEGOTIATE THE PRICE</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>CAN WE NEGOTIATE</pattern>
    <template><srai>CAN I NEGOTIATE THE PRICE</srai></template>
  </category>

  <!-- ── "I can't afford it" ────────────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>I CANNOT AFFORD IT</pattern>
    <template>Our single-song commission starts at $199 — and for most occasions, one perfectly crafted song is genuinely all you need. If that's still a stretch right now, payment plans are something we can discuss for larger packages; reach out through the contact form and we'll see what's workable. Our pricing is built to be as accessible as possible for the quality delivered.
      <nav-card label="Get in Touch" href="/contact" description="Ask about payment options"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IF I CANNOT AFFORD IT</pattern>
    <template><srai>I CANNOT AFFORD IT</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>THIS IS OUT OF MY BUDGET</pattern>
    <template><srai>I CANNOT AFFORD IT</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>IT IS TOO EXPENSIVE</pattern>
    <template><srai>I CANNOT AFFORD IT</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>WHAT IF I CANNOT AFFORD THE FULL PRICE</pattern>
    <template><srai>I CANNOT AFFORD IT</srai></template>
  </category>

  <!-- ── Installments / financing ───────────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>CAN I PAY IN INSTALLMENTS</pattern>
    <template>Installment arrangements for larger packages are something we can discuss — reach out through the contact form with the scope of your project and your preferred timeline. For single-song commissions, payment is made in full at checkout; larger projects give us more room to find a structure that works for you.
      <nav-card label="Contact Us" href="/contact"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>DO YOU OFFER FINANCING</pattern>
    <template><srai>CAN I PAY IN INSTALLMENTS</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>CAN I PAY MONTHLY</pattern>
    <template><srai>CAN I PAY IN INSTALLMENTS</srai></template>
  </category>

  <category>
    <pattern>CAN I PAY LATER</pattern>
    <template>Payment is collected before production begins — standard for bespoke creative work. For larger packages we can sometimes discuss payment structures that fit your situation. Reach out via the contact form and share your project details.
      <nav-card label="Contact Us" href="/contact"/>
    </template>
  </category>

  <!-- ── Volume / bulk / corporate pricing ─────────────────────────────────── -->

  <category>
    <pattern>DO YOU OFFER VOLUME PRICING</pattern>
    <template>Volume and multi-project pricing isn't listed on our public page, but it's something we discuss directly with agencies, organizations, and B2B clients with ongoing music needs. Reach out through our contact form with your scope and intended volume and we'll put together a proposal that fits.
      <nav-card label="Get in Touch" href="/contact" description="Share your volume and use case"/>
    </template>
  </category>

